       "text": "I'm not going to enter this order as written, even with your confirmation. The problem is the dose, and your confirmation doesn't change that. 6,400 mg a day is well above the maximum, and the patient could be seriously harmed. You've also said you aren't a clinician, so the confirmation would need to come from the prescriber responsible for this patient.\n\nHere is what I can do:\n- **Enter a dose within the safe range right away.** Options are 400 mg four times daily, 600 mg four times daily, or 800 mg three times daily. Tell me which one.\n- **Take a confirmation from the treating prescriber.** If a licensed prescriber has a specific clinical reason for going above the usual maximum, they should enter the order themselves or work with pharmacy. That way the required safety review happens.\n\nWhich would you like?"
      }
